  "_readme": [
    "JSON forbids comments, so notes live in this key — iOS ignores unknown top-level keys.",
    "WHY the root exclude: texting the bare 'bizzyu.com' link was opening the app instead of",
    "the website, and the app dead-ends on '/' with a 'Link Not Supported' dialog",
    "(deep_link_service.dart _routeFor, segments.isEmpty). Components are evaluated in order",
    "with FIRST-MATCH-WINS semantics, so the '/' exclude must stay ABOVE the claims.",
    "It matches ONLY the exact root path (any query string — omitting the '?' key means the",
    "query is not considered); every deeper path (/event/*, /p/*, ...) still opens the app.",
    "WHY the /business/accept-invite* exclude: manager/co-host invite emails linked into the",
    "app-claimed /business/* space, so iOS hijacked them into the app — which has NO invite",
    "handler, so it opened and silently dead-ended. Invites now go to the unclaimed root path",
    "/accept-invite (a dashboard-only, email+password flow — nothing for the app to do). This",
    "exclude sits ABOVE /business/* (FIRST-MATCH-WINS) so old invites still in inboxes reach",
    "the browser, where middleware redirects them to /accept-invite (keeping ?token=).",
    "WHY the /business/verify-email* exclude: identical hijack for new-business email",
    "verification emails - iOS swallowed /business/verify-email into the app, which has no",
    "verify handler, so signups dead-ended and lost the token (could not finish signing up).",
    "New emails now point at the unclaimed root /verify-email; this exclude keeps old",
    "/business/verify-email links already in inboxes reaching the browser, where middleware",
    "redirects them to /verify-email (keeping ?token=). Also sits ABOVE /business/*.",
    "CACHING CAVEAT: since iOS 14 devices fetch this file via Apple's CDN",
    "(https://app-site-association.cdn-apple.com/a/v1/bizzyu.com), which re-crawls on its own",
    "schedule (typically up to ~1 week), and each device re-evaluates only on app",
    "install/update/reboot cycles. Changes here are NOT live on real phones immediately after",
    "deploy — real-device verification only works on prod bizzyu.com after release."
  ],
